Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n1,"Start the J and J local contacts process") -> action(n2,"Identify the business need") -> action(n3,"Gather the business requirements") -> action(n4,"Create the RFP") -> action(n5,"Create a scorecard from the business requirements") -> action(n6,"Submit the RFP to vendors") -> action(n7,"Score the proposals received from vendors") -> action(n8,"Request a response from vendors by a set date") -> action(n9,"Downselect vendors based on scored proposals to present their proposals") -> action(n10,"Receive presentations from downselected vendors") -> action(n11,"Score the presentations received") -> action(n12,"Attend presentations and conduct Q and A sessions") -> action(n13,"Rescore proposals based on presentations and Q and A") -> action(n14,"Is pricing and scope adjustment necessary") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n17,"Review updated proposals and rescore") -> converge(c2) -> action(n18,"Notify vendors of selection") -> action(n19,"Create contract based on winning proposal") -> action(n20,"You have completed this procedure") -> end(e1)